  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Arcforge Players Compendium</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Mana sphere, Technomancy sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you create or move a sprite into a creature, you may create a manabond with the creature as if you had affected them with an expunge or (manipulation). Whenever you create a manabond with a creature, you may move a sprite into them. A sprite may create or concentrate on a manabond between you and a creature that contains it in place of executing a program.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mana#toc113\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
